{title: Was ich bruuche}
{artist: Christine Engel}
{key: C}

{comment: Chorus 1}
[C] [F] [G] [C] [Am] [F] [G] [C]
Was i bruuche gisch du mir,
darum Herr, bin i bi dir,
wil niemer anders biete cha,
was i, Herr, bi dir cha ha.
Was i bruuche gisch du mir,
darum Herr, bin i bi dir,
wil niemer anders biete cha,
was i, Herr, bi dir cha ha.

{comment: Chorus 2}
[F] [C] [G] [C]
Und du mir Sünde gärn vergisch,
wil du e Gott vo der Liebi bisch,
und du mir Sünde gärn vergisch,
wil du e Gott vo der Liebi bisch.
